    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf2a Dodge, dive, and strike back in a world of deadly beauty!</strong><br>Master Psyche\u2019s high mobility to slip through bullet storms. Time your moves precisely, unleash powerful skills with your allies, and turn the tide in even the most desperate battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Unveil the ancient secrets of Oz and the Old Gods</strong><br>Venture through the corrupted homelands of the Lion, Tin Man, and Scarecrow. Discover what lies beneath the surface of the enchanted kingdom\u2014and uncover a forgotten mythos tied to the Old Gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Three companions, three playstyles \u2013 your combat, your way</strong><br>Each ally comes with distinct abilities and upgrade paths. Choose your favorite playstyle and build synergies to enhance their power, crafting your own rhythm of battle as you purge the spirits haunting the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dive into the borderland between dream and nightmare?<br>The gears of fate are turning\u2026 and the spirits are drawing near.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf2a Dodge, dive, and strike back in a world of deadly beauty!</strong><br>Master Psyche\u2019s high mobility to slip through bullet storms. Time your moves precisely, unleash powerful skills with your allies, and turn the tide in even the most desperate battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Unveil the ancient secrets of Oz and the Old Gods</strong><br>Venture through the corrupted homelands of the Lion, Tin Man, and Scarecrow. Discover what lies beneath the surface of the enchanted kingdom\u2014and uncover a forgotten mythos tied to the Old Gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Three companions, three playstyles \u2013 your combat, your way</strong><br>Each ally comes with distinct abilities and upgrade paths. Choose your favorite playstyle and build synergies to enhance their power, crafting your own rhythm of battle as you purge the spirits haunting the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dive into the borderland between dream and nightmare?<br>The gears of fate are turning\u2026 and the spirits are drawing near.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Dream of Limbo \u2013 Into the Border of Nightmares and Fairy Tales Dive into a dark fairytale. Play as Psyche, who fights to protect her friends. Team up with three companions to face vengeful spirits corrupting Oz, and glide through dazzling, deadly barrages in this fast-paced bullet hell.",
